### REGISTRO - Usuario nuevo
POST http://localhost:3000/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gonzalo Test",
  "email": "gonzalo@test.com",
  "password": "mipassword123"
}

### LOGIN - Usuario existente
POST http://localhost:3000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gms@mail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### CREAR PARTIDO
POST http://localhost:3000/api/partidos
Authorization: Bearer PEGA_AQUI_TU_TOKEN_ADMIN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "equipoLocal": "Real Madrid",
  "equipoVisitante": "Barcelona",
  "fecha": "2026-06-15T21:00:00Z",
  "descripcion": "El Clásico LaLiga",
  "streamUrl": "https://demo.unified-streaming.com/k8s/features/stable/video/tears-of-steel/tears-of-steel.ism/.m3u8"
}

### LISTA PARTIDOS (público)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/partidos

### DETALLE PARTIDO
GET http://localhost:3000/api/partidos/ID_PARTIDO

### PARTIDO NO EXISTE (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/partidos/123-no-existe

### CREAR ADMIN (solo funciona si el email ya existe o no hay admin)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin",
  "email": "a@mail.com",
  "password": "1234567",
  "secretKey": "tfg_admin_2026"
}

### LISTA USUARIOS (solo admin - actualizar el token)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### EDITAR PARTIDO (solo admin - cambiar el id y el token)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/admin/partidos/PEGA_AQUI_UN_ID_REAL
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": "en-directo"
}

### ELIMINAR PARTIDO (solo admin - cambiar el id y el token)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/admin/partidos/ID_PARTIDO
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN